node_modules/
out/

# Song projects are LOCAL and never committed. A piano source is often copyrighted,
# and a cover is a derivative work of it — neither belongs in this public toolchain
# repo, which "ships no example arrangement on purpose." Everything under a project
# slug stays local; only the scaffold README is tracked. This includes each project's
# history/ tab version store (tools/history.mjs) — the local record of every iteration.
projects/*
!projects/README.md

# The corpus is READ-ONLY input (often copyrighted piano scores), not part of the
# toolchain. Clone supplies their own; tests that read it simply skip if absent.
CanonRock/

# Agent session state — not shipped.
.zcode/
